  "description": "Professional HTTP-based SDK for TAF Metadata Service. v9.1.0: Added EnvironmentId header transmission support - now required by API for version resolution and TAB Platform metadata queries. Updated all XML documentation to include EnvironmentId in context descriptions. v9.0.5: Added BusContext extension methods for fluent metadata access in dynamically compiled scripts and hooks. New MetadataRequestBuilder pattern enables context.GetAppObject(\"Name\").WithVersion(\"1.0\").ExecuteAsync<T>() syntax. Includes extensions for all metadata operations (AppObject, CustomScript, Screen, Query, Connection) with proper DI integration. v9.0.4: CRITICAL FIX - Fixed 3 more methods (GetCustomScriptsByAppObjectIdAsync, GetCustomScriptByIdAsync, GetScreenByIdAsync) with same OperationResult unwrapping bug. All methods now correctly call ProcessResponseAsync with unwrapped types. v9.0.3: Fixed GetAppObjectAsync unwrapping bug. v9.0.0: BREAKING CHANGES - All methods now require BusContext instead of Context parameter (MassTransit v2.0.0 compatibility). Upgraded to TAF.Infra.MassTransit v2.0.0 and TAF.Infra.Contract v1.9.0 with centralized OperationResult pattern. v8.0.0: Removed includeQueries parameter, added dedicated Query endpoints. Features Clean Architecture, SOLID principles, explicit BusContext parameter support, comprehensive error handling, screen management, batch relations support, and GUID-based lookups.",
